ontation took place on Mount Carmel.","1 Kings 18:19–20"],["elisha-double-portion","who-am-i","elisha-double-spirit","elisha-asked-double-portion","Who requested a double portion of Elijah's spirit?",["Samuel","Daniel","Elisha"],"C","Elisha asked Elijah for a double portion.","2 Kings 2:9"],["elijah-whirlwind","trick","elijah-taken-whirlwind","elijah-went-up-whirlwind","Who was taken up to heaven in a whirlwind?",["Elijah","Elisha","Enoch"],"A","Elijah went up to heaven in a whirlwind.","2 Kings 2:11"],["naaman-seven-washes","numbers","naaman-jordan-seven-times","naaman-dipped-seven-times","How many times was Naaman told to wash in the Jordan?",["Three","Seven","Twelve"],"B","Naaman was told to wash seven times.","2 Kings 5:10"],["esther-queen-persia","who-am-i","esther-persian-queen","esther-chosen-queen","Which Jewish woman became queen in Persia?",["Ruth","Deborah","Esther"],"C","Esther became queen.","Esther 2:17"],["nehemiah-rebuild-wall","who-am-i","nehemiah-jerusalem-wall","nehemiah-rebuilt-wall","Who led the rebuilding of Jerusalem's wall?",["Nehemiah","Ezra","Jeremiah"],"A","Nehemiah led the effort to rebuild the wall.","Nehemiah 6:15"],["daniel-lions-den","who-am-i","daniel-lions-den","daniel-thrown-lions-den","Who was thrown into a den of lions?",["Ezekiel","Daniel","Isaiah"],"B","Daniel was cast into the lions' den.","Daniel 6:16"],["belshazzar-writing-wall","trick","belshazzar-wall-writing","belshazzar-saw-handwriting","Which king saw mysterious writing on a wall?",["Nebuchadnezzar","Darius","Belshazzar"],"C","Belshazzar saw writing appear on the wall.","Daniel 5:5"],["daniel-interprets-writing","who-am-i","daniel-wall-interpreter","daniel-explained-writing","Who explained the mysterious writing on the wall?",["Daniel","Mordecai","Ezra"],"A","Daniel interpreted the writing.","Daniel 5:25–28"],["three-men-fiery-furnace","numbers","shadrach-meshach-abednego","three-hebrews-fiery-furnace","How many men were thrown into the fiery furnace?",["Two","Three","F